thag1.111:1.3 | S: Getting by is difficult for we <j>who accept whatever comes, | T: it’s hard to keep going with whatever we get:
thag1.111:1.4 | S: so we should always think about impermanence. | T: So it’s right that we ponder continually continual inconstancy.
