thag2.19:2.3 | S: I practiced rationally and extracted | T: I, practicing appropriately,
thag2.19:2.4 | S: attachment to continued existence from my mind. | T: plucked my mind out of becoming.
thag2.19:2.5 | P: … Nando thero …. | T: (none)


