## thag2.32
thag2.32:1.1 | S: Houses are impermanent— | T: Inconstant little houses:
thag2.32:1.2 | S: on and on, life after life. | T: now here, now there, again & again,
thag2.32:1.3 | S: I’ve been searching for the house-builder— | T: I sought the house-builder.
thag2.32:1.4 | S: painful is birth again and again. | T: Painful is birth, again & again.
thag2.32:2.1 | S: I’ve seen you, house-builder! | T: House-builder, you’re seen!
